**From Yang et al. 2023**:

| Task | Manual | APE | OPRO | OPRO Gain |
|------|--------|-----|------|-----------|
| **GSM8K** | 65% | 78% | **82%** | **+4pp over APE** |
| **BBH** | 55% | 63% | **68%** | **+5pp over APE** |
